      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm running a manufacturing plant in ohio and we're getting hit hard by these new carbon emission standards coming down the line. i need to prep for a meeting with some local reps to push back on this. can you give me a solid list of arguments against these new regulations that i can use to show how they're gonna hurt local businesses?",
